<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1295_4421.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vnser</unclear> freündtliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbaürliche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> gantz guet-
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willige</unclear> dienst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuuor</unclear>, fürsichtige, ersame, weise, in-
<lb n="3"/>sonders liebe freünd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbaüren</unclear>, Auf <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüer</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anbiten</unclear> wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüers</unclear> gefangnen, der sich <persName resp="#ner">Conraedt
<lb n="5"/>Sailer</persName> ab der Leinen, nennen thuet, Jungstgethones
<lb n="6"/>schreiben, Thuend wir eüch hiemit, vnsers ge-
<lb n="7"/>westnen gefangnen, <persName resp="#ner">Hilarius <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mosers</unclear></persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-469" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Collmar</placeName>
<lb n="8"/>gehaissen, welcher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwuckter</unclear> tagen, vmb seiner
<lb n="9"/>begangnen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">missetheten</unclear> willen, alhie zum
<lb n="10"/>tod verurtheilt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> mit dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">strang</unclear> gericht
<lb n="11"/>worden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergicht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekantnus</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüerm</unclear> begeren
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaeß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inligendt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schicken</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> seyen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ferners</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alle</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> freünd: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbaürschafft</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerweisen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jderzeit</unclear> gantz berait <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> willig.
<lb n="15"/>Datum den <origDate when="1593-05-22" cert="medium" resp="#ner">22 Maij. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> 93</origDate>.
<lb n="16"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Haubtman</unclear>, Burgermeister <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>Rath der Statt Costantz</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1295_4422.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1295_4423.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="18"/>Namlichen, und deß ersten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">als</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> nach seinen
<lb n="19"/>lerjaren seinem handtwerch nachgezogen,
<lb n="20"/>habe er uff ain zeüt nechst beÿ <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Basel</placeName> in ainer
<lb n="21"/>statt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koende</unclear> aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diselbige</unclear> nit nennen, ainem
<lb n="22"/>mann, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> ime in der kamer gelegen,
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">5</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hosen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entwert</unclear>.
<lb n="24"/>Nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demselben</unclear> habe er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sidert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschinen</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>somers im herbst nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainanderen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vier</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geselen</unclear> gehabt.
<lb n="27"/>Der ain habe <persName resp="#ner">Borius</persName> gehaissen, auß dem
<lb n="28"/><orgName resp="#ner">Grueninger Ampt</orgName>, etwas lenger dann
<lb n="29"/>er, habe ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwartz</unclear> angesicht mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vill</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lueschlin</unclear>, und trage weiß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noerdling</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>hosen an.
<lb n="32"/>Der ander habe <persName resp="#ner">Steffan</persName> gehaissen, auß
<lb n="33"/>ainem dorff, .<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">4</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">viertel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ob</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-112" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Straßburg</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="34"/>hab kain bart, trage schwartz strimpff,
<lb n="35"/>weiß luendisch hosen, ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zerschnitens</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">barchatin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wames</unclear>, und ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">traiten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huet</unclear>.
<lb n="37"/>Der drit habe <persName resp="#ner">Clauß</persName> gehaissen, von <placeName resp="#ner">Luschna,</placeName>
<lb n="38"/>am <placeName resp="#ner">Wranbzersee</placeName>, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿe</unclear> aber
<lb n="39"/>siderthero gestorben.
<lb n="40"/>Der viert <persName resp="#ner">Christan</persName> genandt auß dem <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-114" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Churtal</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="41"/>habe weiß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwilchin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wames</unclear> und hosen an,
<lb n="42"/>und ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thurgoewer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿe</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>noch ain junger bueb,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1295_4424.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="44"/>Mit hilff diser gesellen, habe er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachuolgende</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sachen</unclear>, und auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verricht</unclear>,
<lb n="46"/>wie hernach volgt,
<lb n="47"/>Item Im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-13" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bernner</placeName> piet, habe er mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mitgselen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">8</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entwendt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dauon</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>aber Ime zuo seinem theil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear>,
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dann</unclear> 1 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">½</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>,
<lb n="51"/>Item zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-325" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Riedlingen</placeName> im <placeName resp="#ner">Baßler</placeName> piet, habe er
<lb n="52"/>ainem auß ainem sekel genomen 3 f.
<lb n="53"/>Mer zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Schletstatt</placeName> in ainem hauß, auß
<lb n="54"/>ainem kruegli 1 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">½</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>.
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Litenholtz</unclear></placeName> auß ainem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">faltzenneli</unclear>,
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstell</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geleg</unclear> 1 ½ f.
<lb n="57"/>Mer habe er zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Basel</placeName> ainem ain
<lb n="58"/>sekel auß den hosen genomen. Darinn
<lb n="59"/>10 Plapart gewesen,
<lb n="60"/>Mer zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Waltweiler</placeName> bey <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Basel</placeName>, habe er
<lb n="61"/>auß ainer büx 2 ½ f entwendt,
<lb n="62"/>Mer zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-342" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Freyburg</placeName> in <placeName resp="#ner">Uchtlandt</placeName>, habe
<lb n="63"/>er auch ainem auß den hosen 1 ½ f entwendt,
<lb n="64"/>Item zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Basel</placeName> seye er auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anstifftung</unclear>
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seines</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesellen</unclear> in ain laden gangen,
<lb n="66"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daselbsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schribfedrli</unclear> genomen,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1295_4425.jpg" n="5"/>
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seÿe</unclear> aber daran <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwuͤscht</unclear>, und dar=
<lb n="68"/>umben fengclich eingezogen worden,
<lb n="69"/>nachgends aber one marter, oder ent=
<lb n="70"/>geltnus dadannen ledig gelaßen.
<lb n="71"/>Item <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-102" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wÿl</unclear></placeName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Turgoͤw</unclear></placeName> uff dem marckht,
<lb n="72"/>habe er ainem paursman, sin seckel aus
<lb n="73"/>den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hoßen</unclear> genomen, darinnen
<lb n="74"/>20 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">patzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwaÿerli</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geweßen</unclear>,
<lb n="75"/><date resp="#ner">16 martii</date>.
<lb n="76"/>Item zuo <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Allschweÿler</unclear></placeName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baßler piet</placeName>, habe
<lb n="77"/>er ainem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pauren</unclear> auß dem hauß ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leini</unclear>
<lb n="78"/>wammes <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entwert</unclear>, das er selbsten
<lb n="79"/>antragen und verzert,
<lb n="80"/>Item Im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-49" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Solothurner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">piet</unclear></placeName>, an ainem ort,
<lb n="81"/>wüß es nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuonenen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dreÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoͤff</unclear>
<lb n="82"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daselbsten</unclear>, hab er ain beltzschlappen
<lb n="83"/>entwert, und dieselben auch selbst
<lb n="84"/>antragen,
<lb n="85"/>Mer im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baßler piet</placeName> ain pfriem mit
<lb n="86"/>silber bschlagen. darauß er 3 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pla=</unclear>
<lb n="87"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">phart</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geloͤst</unclear>.
<lb n="88"/>Mer ainer gemainen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diernen</unclear>
<lb n="89"/>ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">par</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stiffel</unclear>. darauß er
<lb n="90"/>5 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">plapart</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geloͤst</unclear>,
<lb n="91"/>Item zuo <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Moßhug</unclear></placeName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-197" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Freÿburger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">piet</unclear></placeName>, hab er
<lb n="92"/>auß ainem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würtshauß</unclear> 7 kr entwert,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1295_4426.jpg" n="6"/>
<lb n="93"/>Item zuo <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Affelden</unclear></placeName> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freyen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">empteren</unclear>,
<lb n="94"/>habe er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> aines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pauren</unclear> hauß ain
<lb n="95"/>schmalbayer weiber roekh. so an ainer
<lb n="96"/>stang gehangt. entwert. Darauß
<lb n="97"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1</unclear> 1/2 fl geloest.
<lb n="98"/>Item zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Salmschweyl</placeName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-49" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Soluthurner</placeName> piet,
<lb n="99"/>hab er auch auß ainem hauß ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lündisch</unclear>
<lb n="100"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">par</unclear> hosen entwert. so er gegen
<lb n="101"/>ainem dienstknecht umb 2 1/2 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver=</unclear>
<lb n="102"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kauft</unclear>.
<lb n="103"/>Item in ainem dorf nebent <placeName resp="#ner">weyl</placeName>
<lb n="104"/>außhin. seye ain <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schloß</unclear> darbey.
<lb n="105"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koends</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemen</unclear>. hab er und sein
<lb n="106"/>gesell <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Christen</unclear> in ainem hauß linwadt,
<lb n="107"/>so noch am <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">webstul</unclear> gewesen. abge=
<lb n="108"/>schniten. seye <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungevär</unclear> 60 Elen
<lb n="109"/>gewesen. abgeschniten Daß selbig
<lb n="110"/>seye gegen ainem kroemer die Elen
<lb n="111"/>umb j batz verkhauft,
<lb n="112"/>Item zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-160" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Waldkirch</unclear></placeName>. habe diser sin
<lb n="113"/>gesell ainem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pauren</unclear> ainen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seckhel</unclear>
<lb n="114"/>auß dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">läplin</unclear> im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wames</unclear> genomen,
<lb n="115"/>darinnen 5 fl gewesen, seye Ime
<lb n="116"/>darvon dz halb theil worden,
<lb n="117"/>Item das gelt, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> in seinem seckel,
<lb n="118"/>funden worden. habe er zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-57" cert="medium" resp="#ner">waltzhuot</placeName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1295_4427.jpg" n="7"/>
<lb n="119"/>in ainem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kestlin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entwert</unclear>.
<lb n="120"/>Item beij Duggwyl. habe er. und sein
<lb n="121"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesell</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungeuar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">100</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">elen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuoch</unclear>.
<lb n="122"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ab</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">webstuol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschniten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear>
<lb n="123"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkaufft</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">elen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">p</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">5</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1/2</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">k</unclear>.
<lb n="124"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Item</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rheinthal</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegen</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-89" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Veldkirch</unclear></placeName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hab</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear>
<lb n="125"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsell</unclear>. ain loch in ainen
<lb n="126"/>keller gebrochen. darauß beij
<lb n="127"/>15 lb rinders und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schweins</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flaisch</unclear>.
<lb n="128"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßgleichen</unclear>. 5. lb schmer entweent,
<lb n="129"/>auß dem pfundt flaisch 2 k. und
<lb n="130"/>schmär ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">batzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelößt</unclear>.
<lb n="131"/>Zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-116" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">S</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Margrethen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ob</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-87" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rorschach</unclear></placeName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habe</unclear>
<lb n="132"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">3</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">garn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entwert</unclear>. und auß dem
<lb n="133"/>pfundt 5 k gelößt.
<lb n="134"/>Item <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zürich</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">helmhauß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear>
<lb n="135"/>ainem ain seckel auß den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hosen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ent</unclear>-
<lb n="136"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wert</unclear>. darinnen 1 1/2 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
